{"step_index":135,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T18:44:15Z","content":"The build for **LifeChart (लाइफचार्ट)** is complete, verified, and ready to use in `C:\\Users\\Lenovo\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\lifechart`.\n\n---\n\n### 🏥 What Was Built\n\n1. **Old Records Digitiser (Main Differentiator)**:\n   - Client-side OCR powered by **Tesseract.js** extracting doctor, clinic, date, diagnosis, and medications.\n   - Built-in sample prescriptions and camera/upload support.\n   - Interactive human-in-the-loop review form allowing corrections before saving to the timeline.\n\n2. **Lifelong Health Timeline (2004–2024)**:\n   - 20-year chronological health timeline for patient **Rajesh Kumar** with filters for year, doctor, record type, and diagnosis.\n   - Color-coded medical badges: Prescriptions (Blue), Lab Reports (Purple), Diagnoses (Red), Vaccinations (Green), ABDM-linked (Teal).\n\n3. **Doctor Quick Summary (Single-Screen 60s View)**:\n   - High-contrast allergy warnings (Penicillin, Sulfa drugs) in red alerts.\n   - Active chronic conditions with duration (Hypertension since 2018).\n   - Current medications list.\n   - Past similar illnesses with historical recovery times and effective treatments.\n   - Clinical note and new prescription submission form.\n\n4. **Consent Sharing & DPDP Act 2023 Compliance**:\n   - 6-digit clinic passcode and 24-hour QR code generator for healthcare providers.\n   - Granular permissions (Read vs. Read+Add) with instant revocation.\n   - Immutable audit log tracking which doctor accessed which record and at what time.\n\n5. **Family Dashboard & UIP Pediatric Vaccination**:\n   - Multi-profile management (Rajesh, Anita, and children).\n   - India's **Universal Immunization Programme (UIP)** schedule tracker (BCG, OPV, Rotavirus, Measles-Rubella, DPT).\n\n6. **Emergency Card**:\n   - Offline-ready, self-contained QR code encoding blood group (`B+`), allergies, and emergency contacts.\n   - Print-optimized layout (`@media print`) designed for wallet cards.\n\n7. **Bilingual English & हिंदी**:\n   - Instant language toggle via `react-i18next` with culturally appropriate medical terms in Devanagari script.\n\n8. **Database & Security**:\n   - Supabase SQL migration (`001_initial_schema.sql`) with 8 tables and Row Level Security (`(SELECT auth.uid())` optimized query pattern).\n   - Mock ABDM integration service with clearly marked `// ABDM_INTEGRATION_POINT` markers for future live gateway connection.\n\n---\n\n### 🧪 Verification Results\n\n- **TypeScript Compilation (`tsc -b`)**: Passed with 0 errors.\n- **Production Build (`vite build`)**: Successfully bundled into `dist/` (`index.html`, `index.css`, `index.js`).\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Running the App\n\nTo run LifeChart locally in your terminal:\n\n```powershell\ncd C:\\Users\\Lenovo\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\lifechart\nnpm run dev\n```\n\nThen visit **`http://localhost:5173`** in your browser. You can click **\"One-Click Demo Access\"** on the login page to immediately explore Rajesh Kumar's 20-year health timeline. Detailed notes are available in [`walkthrough.md`](file:///C:/Users/Lenovo/.gemini/antigravity/brain/36cc7eb8-3f8c-4b85-9baf-abdd496c58d8/walkthrough.md)."}
